          <Pad Id="R8qpaSZzjKoCoAz7gAVWOG" Bounds="60,90,600,46" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Well-Known Binary is how a database stores a geometry. PostGIS prints it as hex text: the (Hex) versions read and write that text.">
